{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19775","headline":"楚竹吟酬卢虔端公见和湘弦怨 · 孟郊","name":"楚竹吟酬卢虔端公见和湘弦怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握中有新声，楚竹人未闻。\n识音者谓谁，清夜吹赠君。\n昔爲潇湘引，曾动潇湘云。\n一呌凤改听，再惊鹤失羣。\n江花匪秋落，山日当昼曛。\n衆浊响杂沓，孤清思氛氲。\n欲知怨有形，愿向明月分。\n一掬灵均泪，千年湘水文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}